    "schemaVersion": 1,
    "description": "<section class=\"hol-item-reference\"><p class=\"hol-automation-label\"><strong>Automation:</strong> Rules reference · resolve effects at the table</p><div class=\"hol-reference-flavor\"><p>A low gust lifts your companions&#39; steps over the rubble, giving each a little more room to choose the next move.</p></div><h2>Rules</h2><dl class=\"hol-reference-details\"><div><dt>Action</dt><dd>Maneuver</dd></div><div><dt>Attribute</dt><dd>None (no roll)</dd></div><div><dt>Target / range / shape</dt><dd>Up to three visible willing creatures within 4 squares, including yourself.</dd></div><div><dt>Type</dt><dd>Magic / Movement</dd></div></dl><div class=\"hol-reference-rules\"><p>Each recipient may move up to 2 squares without provoking. Difficult terrain costs 1 movement per square for this move.</p></div><p class=\"hol-reference-source\"><strong>Source:</strong> <a href=\"https://github.com/bruceamoser/heroes-of-legend/blob/f3fb98ca03b046335fcc730c1b05689bebf091b4/design/cards/the-wind-makes-room.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">design/cards/the-wind-makes-room.md</a> at <code>f3fb98ca03b046335fcc730c1b05689bebf091b4</code>.</p></section>",
